Metal kernels for the Prism ML ternary types and the Hadamard transform: PQ2_0 and PTQ1_0 mat-vec
(one, a few and gate-up-swiglu columns), the ToshGEMM tiles on both widths, get_rows and copies,
and one kernel for sign flip, head regrouping and FWHT, alone or after the rms_norm and residual add
that feed it. Types follow PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp, branch prism (MIT, The ggml authors).
Also, for every qwen35 model: gated_delta_net with 16 lanes per state row, reading and writing the
recurrent cache directly and taking the q and k l2 norms on one-token batches.

